/27/5983940/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし気分が変わって違った服だったらごめんなちゃいっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブで色紙にサイン書く時真夏って書こうと思ったら混ざってしまったから読み仮名ふっといた～(๑>ᴗ<๑)テヘッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だれがもらってくれたのかなぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏ということで真夏が写ってる写メ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田、松村、西野、深川、秋元、中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！全部みんな名字二文字だ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このまあやがきてる仙台のツアーTシャツお気に入り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてレッスン着といえばこれ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるかな？(๑′ᗨ‵๑)੭にひっ\nこの派手な服といえば！乃木團のメンバーが台湾に行った時にわざわざまあやに似合う！と思って買ってきてくれた服～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても派手だよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん来てリハしてるよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木團メンバーありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてみなみとは全国握手会ではペアでしたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段からっていうか初期の頃からずーーーっと仲良しで‥だからとってもやりやすかったし楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみファンの方ありがとうございました^o^まあ家族さん、いつもありがとうございます\n楽しかったよ～(^O^)みなみがまあやのファンの人まあやみていで楽しかった♪って、言ってくれてたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場も満員で上から見た会場は、人多すぎてモザイクに見えた！ってメイクさんが言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとすごく大変だったと思います。\n会いにきてくださった皆様 本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンの時期の個別は仮装する予定なんだけど何がいいかなぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに久しぶりに三年？三年半？ぐらい久しぶりに、来た人限定でロングヘアーでやろうかな？とか思ってま～す(^^)\n来てくれた方が、来て良かった！って言ってもらいたいから、お洋服も色々迷っちゃう～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら まあやに会いに来て下さいm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね？最近ね、無性に辛いのが食べたくなってね？\nからいの苦手なんだけど...\nおうちの近くのお店行ったらトッポギの～なんか、、カップラーメン的な感じ⁉︎のがあったから買ったのね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原液入れて水で薄めてレンジでチンして食べるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間かなかったから皆と移動の車に乗った時に食べたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがそれが、、そのトッポギめちゃめちゃ辛くて～1人で汗だくでヒーヒー言いながら食べたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかやっぱり辛すぎて、おかしいと思ってカップの作り方の表記見てみたの。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原液のタレに水入れて薄めるの読んでなくて水入れずにトッポギにそのまま原液かけて食べてて‥凄く辛かっの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水分なかったからカチカチだったし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも水を持ってなくて水飲めなくて辛くて大変だった‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この辛さを愚痴りたくなったからここで愚痴った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも仙台でイベントができたってゆうのと、楽しかったからもう平気～\n応援に来てくれてありがとうございました（≧∇≦）\n飛鳥や ひなちゃん、伊織！カッコ良かった～(^O^)\n本当に豪華な沢山のモデルさんや芸人さんも出演してるイベントに呼んでいただけて本当にいい経験になりました！\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛タンも最高～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知が遅れちゃったんだけど、今日は\n乃木英語スペシャルと、乃木ののラジオを\nまあやと、ちーちゃんが出ます！\nそして、乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部も配信されてますので、見てね～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌はEX大衆も週刊プレイボーイも見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山書いちゃったけど、最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント待ってるね♡にひっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/09/27/5983940/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}